<Legal title="KVKK Notice" updated="23 July 2026" description="Sentezy's data controller notice under Türkiye's KVKK.">
  <p>
    This notice is provided under Türkiye's Personal Data Protection Law (KVKK, Law No. 6698). It
    explains, as data controller, how Sentezy processes your personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    Sentezy acts as the data controller for the personal data described here. For any request, write
    to <a href="mailto:hello@sentezy.ai">hello@sentezy.ai</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What data we process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identity and contact data — your email address.</li>
    <li>The content you provide to make a video — product links, uploads and scripts.</li>
    <li>The videos we render for you and the settings behind them.</li>
    <li>Transaction data for credits and payments, handled through our payment provider.</li>
    <li>Technical logs needed to run and secure the service.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why we process it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To create and deliver the videos you request.</li>
    <li>To manage your account and your credits.</li>
    <li>To take payment and keep financial records.</li>
    <li>To keep the service secure and to meet our legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    We process your data where it is necessary to provide the service you asked for, to meet a legal
    obligation, for our legitimate interests in running and securing Sentezy, and, where required,
    on the basis of your consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Transfers</h2>
  <p>
    To run the service we use cloud hosting, a payment processor and AI providers that generate the
    voice, presenter images and script. Your data may be processed by these providers, including
    outside Türkiye, only to the extent needed to deliver the service.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights under Article 11</h2>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Learn whether your data is processed, and request information about it.</li>
    <li>Know the purpose of processing and whether it is used accordingly.</li>
    <li>Have inaccurate data corrected, and request that it be deleted.</li>
    <li>Object to results reached solely by automated analysis.</li>
    <li>Claim compensation for damage caused by unlawful processing.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to make a request</h2>
  <p>
    Send your request to <a href="mailto:hello@sentezy.ai">hello@sentezy.ai</a>. You can also delete
    your account and all of its media at any time from Settings.
  </p>

  <p class="legal-note">
    This is a plain-language draft written for the product. Have it reviewed by a lawyer against the
    current KVKK requirements before launch, and confirm the contact address is one you monitor.
  </p>
</Legal>
